<title>BELGIUM: EU sets molasses import duties.</title>
<headline>EU sets molasses import duties.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union sugar management committee on Wednesday continued the suspension of both beet and cane molasses duties at zero, unchanged from last week, a Commission official said.</p>
<p>The cif reference price for cane molasses was set at 8.31 ecus per 100 kg slightly down from last week's figure of 8.39 ecus, the official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The cif reference price for beet molasses was set at 12.13 ecus per 100 kg down from 12.23 ecus last week.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom: +32 2 287-6830</p>
